      <activity id="fa0b72d6-5c0b-53c4-8eba-4f4ea489403c" activityNameId="6de18da7-15c5-5d32-8055-a8593553c314" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Cyclohexanone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Cyclohexanone, at plant
The process "cyclohexanone, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of cyclohexanone from cyclohexane in Europe. Raw materials and energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000108-94-1; 
Formula: C6H10O; 
UUID: cb1d29fc-0a62-35f9-a249-30a170d80073
Production of cyclohexanone including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Oxidation of cyclohexane
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cb1d29fc-0a62-35f9-a249-30a170d80073.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
